---
title: Concurrency test — two passengers, one last seat
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant T as PHPUnit test
  participant P1 as Process 1 (Salma)
  participant P2 as Process 2 (Youssef)
  participant DB as MySQL (test database)
  T->>DB: create trip with 1 free seat on leg 1
  par started at the same moment
    T->>P1: bin/console app:booking:book (hold lock 1.5 s)
    T->>P2: bin/console app:booking:book
  end
  P1->>DB: SELECT trip FOR UPDATE (gets the lock)
  P2->>DB: SELECT trip FOR UPDATE (blocked, waits)
  P1->>DB: 1 seat free, INSERT booking, COMMIT
  DB-->>P2: lock released
  P2->>DB: 0 seats free, ROLLBACK
  P1-->>T: exit 0 (booked)
  P2-->>T: exit 3 (NotEnoughSeats)
  T->>DB: count CONFIRMED bookings on the trip
  Note over T,DB: Assert exactly 1 success, 1 refusal, never 2 bookings
